8ec1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93d9bc6d\" id=\"u93d9bc6d\">⚡</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2505f43e\" id=\"u2505f43e\">整数除法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue1dcad93\" id=\"ue1dcad93\">：当两个整数相除时，结果也是整数，小数部分会被截断。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ySdFN%22%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20y1%20%3D%2010%20%2F%204%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E4%B8%A4%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E7%9B%B8%E9%99%A4%EF%BC%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20y2%20%3D%2010%20%2F%204.0%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E9%99%A4%E4%BB%A5%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20y3%20%3D%2010.0%20%2F%204%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E6%95%B0%E9%99%A4%E4%BB%A5%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20y4%20%3D%2010%20%2F%20(float)4%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E9%99%A4%E4%BB%A5%E5%BC%BA%E5%88%B6%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%BA%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%844%5Cn%20%20%20%20float%20y5%20%3D%2010%20%2F%204.f%3B%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E9%99%A4%E4%BB%A5%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E6%95%B0%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2210%20%2F%204%20%20%20%3D%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y1)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%202.000000%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2210%20%2F%204.0%20%3D%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y2)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%202.500000%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2210.0%20%2F%204%20%3D%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y3)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%202.500000%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2210%20%2F%20(float)4%20%3D%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y4)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%202.500000%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%2210%20%2F%204.f%20%3D%20%25f%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20y5)%3B%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%3A%202.500000%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XL1UI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u796fa798\" id=\"u796fa798\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud960274d\" id=\"ud960274d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29a03167\" id=\"u29a03167\">✅</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub4bc5a14\" id=\"ub4bc5a14\">浮点数除法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40053b12\" id=\"u40053b12\">：只要操作数中有一个是浮点数，就会执行浮点数除法，结果保留小数部分。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5b554353\" id=\"u5b554353\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae2a0bbf\" id=\"uae2a0bbf\">✅</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u20f20080\" id=\"u20f20080\">类型转换</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7ac88fe\" id=\"uc7ac88fe\">：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8a28be50\" id=\"u8a28be50\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda150594\" id=\"uda150594\">隐式转换：当整数和浮点数一起运算时，整数会自动提升为浮点数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u28e0a64b\" id=\"u28e0a64b\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u642a0b83\" id=\"u642a0b83\">显式转换：可以使用强制类型转换（如(float)4）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3bd77f35\" id=\"u3bd77f35\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaca75ad0\" id=\"uaca75ad0\">✅</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue9b6c6b8\" id=\"ue9b6c6b8\">浮点数常量表示法：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u24932978\" id=\"u24932978\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03ff96b9\" id=\"u03ff96b9\">4.0 和 4.f 都是浮点数常量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4be2f879\" id=\"u4be2f879\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u662cd491\" id=\"u662cd491\">.f后缀明确表示float类型（不加后缀默认是double）</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OKnbK%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"KYba5\" id=\"KYba5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud42db9f5\" id=\"ud42db9f5\">3&gt; 取余（%）运算</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%25%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%20%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20a%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%20%3D%203%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%20%C3%B7%20%25d%20%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%99%E6%95%B0%E6%98%AF%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20a%2C%20b%2C%20a%20%25%20b)%3B%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%25%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i8rGT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KAw8R%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"sbCKz\" id=\"sbCKz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u259ce054\" id=\"u259ce054\">🐻</span><span data-lake-id=\"u97c92312\" id=\"u97c92312\">实践练习：</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u27ec4148\" id=\"u27ec4148\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7cb3905b\" id=\"u7cb3905b\">习题 1&gt; 输入一个3位正整数，输出这个数的个位数字。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8f19cb3a\" id=\"u8f19cb3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16e991aa\" id=\"u16e991aa\">例如： 输入 256，程序应输出 6，  输入 109，程序应输出 9</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22f